AltoChainlinkERC4626RatioMultiplierOracle::updateMultiplierNode()
├── given caller is not owner
│   └── when _multiplierNode is valid
│       └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── given caller is owner
    ├── when _multiplierNode is invalid
    │   ├── when node multiplier is zero
    │   │   └── it should revert with ModuleMultiplierInvalidInput
    │   ├── when node multiplier is greater than 10^54
    │   │   └── it should revert with ModuleMultiplierInvalidInput
    │   └── when node multiplier is not divisible by 10
    │       └── it should revert with ModuleMultiplierInvalidInput
    └── when _multiplierNode is valid
        ├── it should emit SetMultiplierNode with old and new nodes
        ├── it should replace the existing multiplierNode
        └── it should update multiplierNode correctly
